=2 Walkthrough
* After completing {M:The Geomagnetron|The Geomagnetron|The Geomagnetron}, return to {n:Darcia} and ask if she has more work for you.
* {n:Darcia} will grant you a {k:Temporary geomagnetron} and ask you to return to one of the Geomagnetic Founts.
* Travel to one of the locations and attune the device to the Geomagnetic Fount found there. The experience points reward received will depend on the chosen fount:
** {z:Ranguemont Pass}: Southeastern corner, (J-10) - 200 EXP
** {z:Yughott Grotto}: (J-7), in the pond - 200 EXP
** {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}: (K-6), nearest to {z:Jugner Forest} {p:Proto-Waypoint} - 300 EXP
** {z:Monastic Cavern}: First Map, (H-10)
** {z:The Eldieme Necropolis}: Second map (J-10). Fall from first floor (F-8) - 400 EXP
** {z:Ordelle's Caves}: Hidden Apparatus Area (F-12)
** {z:Gusgen Mines}: Last map, NW corner (G-7)
** {z:Dangruf Wadi}: (E-11), after falling in the hole in the hidden tunnel - 300 EXP
** {z:Korroloka Tunnel}: Fifth map (G-9)
** {z:Palborough Mines}: Second map (J-8)
** {z:Gustav Tunnel}: First map, at the pond closest to the Cape Teriggan exit (G-10) - 500 EXP
** {z:Labyrinth of Onzozo}: (J-5), Off the map in the northeast (access from the south).
** {z:Maze of Shakhrami}: First map (K-9) - 300 EXP
** {z:Garlaige Citadel}: (G-8)
** {z:Crawlers' Nest}: First map (F-7) - 400 EXP
** {z:Outer Horutoto Ruins}: (G-7)
** {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins}: Second map (G-7)
** {z:Toraimarai Canal}: (I-6) towards {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins}
* Return to {n:Darcia} to complete the quest.

